WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
This is StockFlow — a live multi-warehouse inventory platform at stock.aliarshad.co paired with an interactive mobile web preview.

00:09.000 --> 00:19.000
Track real-time stock valuation, low-stock alerts, unique SKUs, EAN-13 barcodes, and per-warehouse balances across three hubs.

00:19.000 --> 00:30.000
Transfers and stock adjustments execute inside atomic PostgreSQL transactions so negative inventory can never occur.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
Receive supplier purchase orders into a destination warehouse and move sales orders from reserved to fulfilled and shipped.

00:40.000 --> 00:53.000
In the mobile web preview at stockflow-mobile-web.onrender.com, look up a seeded EAN-13 barcode and commit a stock receipt synced live to the desktop console.

00:53.000 --> 01:00.000
Native camera scanning requires a physical mobile build. Test the live web and mobile preview today at stock.aliarshad.co.
